{"hw":"πώλης","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πώλης</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πώλ-ης</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ου</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">seller, dealer</b>, found only in compds., exc. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">131</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">133</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">140</span> </span> (used comically, as the last part of an intended compd.).</div></div>"}